WEBVTT

01:31.000 --> 01:33.160
Why did it turn out like this?

01:34.040 --> 01:36.560
I've been feeding these silkworms
for seven years.

01:36.640 --> 01:38.920
Is it because of insufficient light

01:39.520 --> 01:40.640
or the wrong food?

01:40.720 --> 01:43.280
Did your master
really use silkworms from Nanzhao?

01:48.600 --> 01:50.520
Nanzhao hasn't produced brocade
in a hundred years.

01:53.160 --> 01:55.560
Can we really weave it within a year?

02:05.040 --> 02:06.680
There are less than four months left.

02:07.920 --> 02:10.759
If we want to leave this place,

02:12.000 --> 02:13.320
we need another plan.

02:15.040 --> 02:17.480
We're skilled artisans.

02:17.560 --> 02:21.560
We can distinguish between Nanzhao silk
and Yizhou silk.

02:22.680 --> 02:25.720
But do you think the King of Nanzhao
can tell the difference?

02:27.920 --> 02:30.240
Even Sheng Fengze,
who claims to be a brocade expert,

02:31.000 --> 02:32.600
can he really tell?

02:35.680 --> 02:36.960
Are you suggesting we use fake brocade?

02:39.720 --> 02:41.160
It can't be completely fake.

02:41.720 --> 02:44.480
The blending ratio of the threads
depends on your judgment.

02:45.320 --> 02:47.240
I remember you hate people
who fake things the most.

02:48.440 --> 02:50.960
Back then, they used fake brocade
to frame my father.

02:51.720 --> 02:54.240
Now, I'm using fake brocade
to save everyone's lives.

02:56.120 --> 02:57.520
Can you do it?

03:03.400 --> 03:04.280
All right.

03:05.160 --> 03:07.000
This will stay between
heaven, earth, you, and me.

03:07.760 --> 03:09.040
If something goes wrong,

03:09.640 --> 03:12.080
just say I picked the wrong thread.

03:12.160 --> 03:13.280
It has nothing to do with you.

03:19.360 --> 03:21.640
CHANG'AN

03:40.440 --> 03:42.840
This guilty servant, Yang Jinglan,
greets Your Highness.

03:54.600 --> 03:55.800
If you're a guilty servant,

03:56.320 --> 04:00.360
then who else on this court
can be called loyal?

04:02.680 --> 04:06.720
Junior, you risked your life
for our master in Yizhou.

04:08.840 --> 04:10.960
Please accept my bow.

04:13.400 --> 04:14.520
And I must thank you, senior,

04:15.440 --> 04:17.760
for trusting me and helping me.

04:21.800 --> 04:23.520
I should also thank all of you

04:23.600 --> 04:26.680
for not abandoning Yizhou City
or my family.

04:26.760 --> 04:30.000
That is the land of Tang and its people.

04:30.080 --> 04:31.120
How could we forsake it?

04:33.320 --> 04:36.280
The Emperor has decided
to deal with Niu Jin

04:37.160 --> 04:38.320
and restore peace to Yizhou.

04:40.120 --> 04:43.040
On behalf of the people of Yizhou,
I thank His Majesty!

04:45.640 --> 04:46.800
The path of righteousness,

04:47.680 --> 04:48.760
though millions stand against me…

04:50.360 --> 04:51.520
I will go forward.

04:55.040 --> 04:59.000
PRINCE BAI'S RESIDENCE

05:04.160 --> 05:07.800
This Nanzhao brocade is entirely made
from Nanzhao silk,

05:07.880 --> 05:09.880
the true Nanzhao brocade.

05:09.960 --> 05:12.720
I ask Your Highness
to present it to the King.

05:13.760 --> 05:15.880
I didn't expect you'd actually succeed,

05:19.800 --> 05:22.800
but even as I watch
you weave the Nanzhao brocade,

05:23.400 --> 05:25.360
I feel no joy at all.

05:26.440 --> 05:27.880
Maybe it's because

05:29.000 --> 05:31.920
the moment
you finished the Nanzhao brocade,

05:32.000 --> 05:33.040
it meant

05:35.520 --> 05:36.960
you'd leave me.

05:39.920 --> 05:41.800
There are two months left in the year.

05:42.360 --> 05:44.080
If we fail to deliver the brocade again,

05:44.160 --> 05:48.040
neither of us nor Your Highness
will remain safe.

05:50.560 --> 05:51.960
None of us will remain safe?

05:54.440 --> 05:56.840
The Tang army has already
marched against Niu Jin.

05:56.920 --> 06:01.080
That's good news for you and Yang Jinglan.

06:01.800 --> 06:03.320
For me…

06:06.160 --> 06:08.040
it's also good news.

06:08.720 --> 06:10.720
With Chang'an's forces
dealing with Niu Jin,

06:11.440 --> 06:12.760
they won't have the capacity

06:13.480 --> 06:15.120
to confront Nanzhao.

06:17.400 --> 06:19.040
Once the flames of war subside,

06:19.640 --> 06:24.120
my brother might show me some mercy.

06:25.560 --> 06:26.840
Then, congratulations, Your Highness.

06:31.000 --> 06:32.520
Congratulations…

06:32.600 --> 06:34.600
Are you congratulating me?

06:36.080 --> 06:38.480
I think you're congratulating yourself!

06:38.560 --> 06:40.440
Congratulations on being able
to leave Nanzhao soon

06:40.520 --> 06:42.240
and leave me behind as well!

06:44.960 --> 06:47.440
You're leaving. What should I do now?

06:49.520 --> 06:51.600
I've thought of a great idea,

06:52.280 --> 06:53.920
an extraordinary idea!

06:57.040 --> 06:59.080
I could burn down the weaving workshop!

07:01.600 --> 07:03.080
The Nanzhao brocade
that could've been woven

07:03.160 --> 07:05.760
would instantly turn into nothing,

07:05.840 --> 07:07.160
reduced to ashes!

07:09.120 --> 07:10.280
Rebuilding the weaving workshop

07:10.360 --> 07:12.400
would take at least six months.

07:12.480 --> 07:13.400
Six months!

07:15.880 --> 07:18.800
Sheng Fengze,
have you forgotten your original goal?

07:18.880 --> 07:21.240
Wasn't everything you did for the sake
of weaving Nanzhao brocade?

07:21.320 --> 07:23.800
I don't care! So what?

07:25.760 --> 07:29.520
Qingping Officer never wanted me
to complete the Nanzhao brocade.

07:29.600 --> 07:32.120
I can claim he set the fire!

07:32.920 --> 07:33.840
Madman.

07:39.560 --> 07:41.240
Didn't you tell me

07:42.120 --> 07:43.560
that people can change?

07:44.320 --> 07:45.320
You're right.

07:46.160 --> 07:47.640
I've changed my mind.

07:47.720 --> 07:49.440
Starting today,

07:50.000 --> 07:52.560
whether it's the brocade or the person,

07:52.640 --> 07:54.720
I want them both!

07:57.120 --> 07:59.160
Your Highness,
Qingping Officer has taken His Majesty

07:59.240 --> 08:00.320
to the weaving workshop.

08:15.320 --> 08:16.520
I've heard

08:16.600 --> 08:18.760
the Nanzhao brocade
has already been completed.

08:26.400 --> 08:29.600
To answer Your Majesty,
a sample brocade has indeed been made,

08:29.680 --> 08:32.159
but the quality is poor.
It cannot be considered Nanzhao brocade.

08:32.240 --> 08:34.520
Therefore,
I didn't report it to Your Majesty.

08:34.600 --> 08:38.240
However, these Tang people
confidently claim

08:38.320 --> 08:40.000
that they've woven the Nanzhao brocade.

08:41.480 --> 08:42.320
Ji Yingying,

08:43.320 --> 08:45.360
why don't you tell His Majesty yourself?

08:46.000 --> 08:48.480
Did you succeed in weaving the brocade

08:49.360 --> 08:50.800
or not?

08:53.240 --> 08:54.160
To answer Your Majesty,

08:54.840 --> 08:57.840
this humble woman
has indeed woven the Nanzhao brocade.

09:01.680 --> 09:02.520
Your Highness,

09:03.240 --> 09:04.960
regardless of its quality,

09:05.040 --> 09:06.520
since His Majesty is here,

09:06.600 --> 09:09.960
why not present the sample brocade
to him for examination?

09:33.760 --> 09:35.720
This is the Nanzhao brocade
woven by Ji Yingying.

09:36.400 --> 09:39.360
Its toughness is lacking.
It tears too easily.

09:42.000 --> 09:46.200
So, you're saying,
after all this time, there's no result?

09:47.160 --> 09:51.480
That's because these Tang people
never put their hearts into weaving.

09:51.560 --> 09:53.520
Instead, they focused
entirely on faking it!

09:57.280 --> 10:00.320
Your Majesty, what you're seeing
isn't Nanzhao brocade.

10:00.400 --> 10:02.200
It's evidence of deception.

10:03.080 --> 10:06.560
And Prince Bai destroyed the brocade
to cover this up.

10:12.440 --> 10:14.400
Your Majesty, I personally overheard

10:14.480 --> 10:16.000
Ji Yingying conspiring with others

10:16.080 --> 10:19.160
to use Yizhou silk
to pass off as Nanzhao silk,

10:19.240 --> 10:21.360
weaving fake brocade to deceive you.

10:22.080 --> 10:24.800
As for whether Prince Bai knew about it,

10:24.880 --> 10:25.720
I'm not sure.

10:29.960 --> 10:31.480
To inform Your Majesty,

10:31.560 --> 10:34.200
I've brought
Nanzhao artisans specifically.

10:35.040 --> 10:39.000
Whether this is our Nanzhao silk,
a single test will reveal the truth.

10:39.080 --> 10:40.120
No need for tests.

10:42.200 --> 10:43.040
Your Majesty,

10:43.640 --> 10:45.800
I am fully aware of this matter.

10:46.480 --> 10:47.480
Not only am I aware,

10:47.560 --> 10:50.480
I was the one who ordered them to do it.

10:51.800 --> 10:54.760
I was thinking,
if we couldn't weave the Nanzhao brocade,

10:54.840 --> 10:57.720
we could use this as a backup plan.

10:57.800 --> 10:59.440
Please punish me.

11:01.600 --> 11:02.960
Your Majesty,

11:03.560 --> 11:06.280
this was entirely Ji Yingying's decision,

11:06.360 --> 11:08.680
driven by personal motives to deceive you.

11:09.640 --> 11:10.760
His Highness truly had no knowledge of it.

11:10.840 --> 11:13.360
If he had known,
he wouldn't have destroyed the brocade.

11:14.080 --> 11:16.400
He was merely
temporarily blinded by his feelings,

11:16.480 --> 11:17.640
trying to protect Ji Yingying.

11:17.720 --> 11:20.000
This is none of your business. Be quiet!

11:20.080 --> 11:21.840
What I said is completely true.

11:23.000 --> 11:25.800
Whether for emotions or for personal gain,

11:27.040 --> 11:30.000
neither should concern a subject.

11:30.600 --> 11:32.120
As subjects,

11:32.200 --> 11:35.520
our primary duty
is to serve Your Majesty and the people.

11:42.400 --> 11:43.600
You don't

11:44.520 --> 11:46.040
seem afraid at all.

11:48.000 --> 11:50.280
That's because we did weave
the Nanzhao brocade.

11:50.360 --> 11:51.200
Our conscience is clear.

11:52.640 --> 11:55.200
But it's not the one
presented by Prince Bai.

12:15.800 --> 12:18.200
With 9,600 warp and weft threads,

12:18.280 --> 12:20.640
every strand was woven from Nanzhao silk.

12:21.640 --> 12:25.480
The dyeing process also incorporated
local Nanzhao techniques.

12:26.200 --> 12:28.760
I ask Your Majesty to have it tested.

12:32.280 --> 12:33.120
Ms. Ji,

12:33.720 --> 12:35.800
if you've already woven
the Nanzhao brocade,

12:35.880 --> 12:38.200
why go through such complex schemes

12:38.280 --> 12:39.640
and involve everyone else?

12:40.360 --> 12:42.160
Everything I've done

12:42.240 --> 12:45.200
was to meet His Majesty in person

12:45.280 --> 12:48.360
and present the genuine Nanzhao brocade.

12:53.280 --> 12:54.880
It's done. It's truly done!

12:56.520 --> 12:59.080
The Nanzhao brocade has finally…

13:00.600 --> 13:02.120
Is there anything wrong with this brocade?

13:07.000 --> 13:07.840
Sit.

13:11.120 --> 13:12.680
The brocade is fine,

13:12.760 --> 13:15.400
but how can we personally
hand it to the King of Nanzhao?

13:15.480 --> 13:16.600
That's the problem.

13:18.800 --> 13:19.720
Exactly.

13:19.800 --> 13:23.480
We're just ordinary people.
It's not like we can easily meet the King.

13:25.520 --> 13:28.200
Do we have to deliver it
personally to the King?

13:28.800 --> 13:30.840
Neither Sheng Fengze nor Du Yan

13:30.920 --> 13:33.440
would ever let the real brocade
reach the King.

13:34.120 --> 13:35.240
That's right.

13:35.320 --> 13:36.960
As soon as they find out
the brocade is finished,

13:37.040 --> 13:38.480
there will be trouble.

13:40.440 --> 13:41.560
What should we do?

13:44.320 --> 13:45.920
I need you to act with me in a play.

13:46.920 --> 13:49.640
Let's use
their mutual distrust to set a trap

13:49.720 --> 13:52.240
with the fake brocade,
luring the King here.

13:53.840 --> 13:56.560
The real brocade is our final trump card

13:56.640 --> 13:57.920
to turn the tables.

14:11.160 --> 14:12.560
The Nanzhao brocade…

14:14.040 --> 14:16.120
Nanzhao finally has its own brocade!

14:17.600 --> 14:20.360
As King,
I am not unworthy of my ancestors.

14:21.000 --> 14:22.800
Congratulations, Your Majesty!

14:24.520 --> 14:26.000
We've fulfilled our mission

14:26.880 --> 14:28.680
and can finally go home.

14:38.600 --> 14:39.560
Ms. Ji,

14:40.120 --> 14:42.400
I'm willing to grant
you wealth and high status.

14:42.480 --> 14:46.280
Would you be willing to stay
and continue serving Nanzhao?

14:47.000 --> 14:48.320
Thank you
for your kind offer, Your Majesty,

14:48.960 --> 14:52.520
but my family and friends
are all in Yizhou.

14:52.600 --> 14:55.040
My mother is still waiting for me
to fulfill my filial duties.

14:55.120 --> 14:58.160
Please forgive me
for declining your gracious offer.

14:58.760 --> 14:59.960
However, I believe

15:00.040 --> 15:03.280
one doesn't have to stay in Nanzhao
to contribute to its prosperity.

15:05.920 --> 15:08.360
I have some influence in Yizhou,

15:08.440 --> 15:10.440
and once I return, I will actively work

15:10.520 --> 15:12.800
to promote brocade trade
between Yizhou and Nanzhao,

15:12.880 --> 15:13.840
ensuring mutual benefit.

15:15.720 --> 15:17.240
This brocade's completion

15:19.840 --> 15:21.720
was thanks to the help
of Nanzhao artisans.

15:24.160 --> 15:28.400
I believe that isolation and secret theft

15:28.480 --> 15:30.040
are not the best solutions.

15:30.640 --> 15:33.240
Only through voluntary communication
and mutual exchange

15:33.800 --> 15:35.840
can we achieve lasting benefits.

15:39.080 --> 15:42.560
Right now, Yizhou
is under Niu Jin's control.

15:43.360 --> 15:45.720
Even if I let you return,

15:46.440 --> 15:48.840
you might have nowhere to settle.

15:50.960 --> 15:52.520
The Tang Empire is vast.

15:53.600 --> 15:55.120
Even if we can't return to Yizhou,

15:55.960 --> 15:58.320
as long as we stand on our homeland,

15:59.120 --> 16:00.400
our hearts will be at peace.

16:02.320 --> 16:05.240
It seems you're determined to leave.

16:14.600 --> 16:16.240
NANZHAO BROCADE COMPLETE, CRAFTSMEN RETURN

16:16.320 --> 16:19.840
This is the contract
that Your Majesty signed with me that day.

16:32.120 --> 16:33.320
Why did you tear it up?

16:36.160 --> 16:38.840
When I first arrived in Nanzhao,
I was uneasy.

16:39.440 --> 16:41.960
So, I requested this contract
from Your Majesty.

16:42.760 --> 16:46.000
But later, I thought about it.
Perhaps I had been worrying too much.

16:47.080 --> 16:48.880
Your Majesty is the ruler of a nation.

16:48.960 --> 16:50.240
Your word is as good as gold.

16:50.320 --> 16:52.960
How could you possibly
break your promise to us commoners?

16:53.040 --> 16:54.240
If word got out,

16:54.320 --> 16:57.200
wouldn't it make the people
and other rulers laugh at you?

16:58.360 --> 17:00.120
Since Your Majesty's word is absolute,

17:01.000 --> 17:03.840
why would I still need
this trivial piece of paper?

17:18.200 --> 17:21.200
Although the brocade sample
is complete now,

17:21.920 --> 17:23.760
if everyone leaves,

17:24.359 --> 17:26.480
who will stay to continue weaving?

17:27.400 --> 17:28.920
Yizhou is in chaos right now.

17:29.000 --> 17:30.240
Here's a better option.

17:30.320 --> 17:33.280
Those willing to stay could remain

17:33.360 --> 17:35.840
to teach Nanzhao's craftsmen their skills.

17:35.920 --> 17:37.000
Oh…

17:46.040 --> 17:46.920
Your Majesty,

17:48.080 --> 17:50.240
this humble servant
is willing to serve you.

17:54.600 --> 17:55.480
Who are you?

17:57.040 --> 17:59.720
This humble servant is Zhao Xiuyuan,
the Brocade Master of Yizhou.

18:00.680 --> 18:01.840
I started weaving at the age of eight.

18:01.920 --> 18:03.200
If nothing else,

18:03.920 --> 18:06.640
weaving brocade is what I excel at.

18:07.400 --> 18:11.000
Besides, Nanzhao's patterns
were also created by me.

18:11.080 --> 18:14.560
These brocade samples
were all my collaborative work.

18:16.280 --> 18:18.640
You're willing to stay
in Nanzhao to weave brocade?

18:20.760 --> 18:23.480
Good. What do you want in return?

18:27.640 --> 18:29.160
This humble servant asks for nothing else,

18:32.400 --> 18:33.680
but only that my fellow townspeople

18:34.480 --> 18:35.640
can return to their homeland soon.

18:51.280 --> 18:53.880
Issue the decree. From today onward,

18:54.800 --> 18:56.600
except for those staying to teach,

18:59.040 --> 19:01.520
allow all Yizhou craftsmen to return home.

19:02.120 --> 19:03.760
No one leaving shall be obstructed.

19:04.440 --> 19:06.040
As for those willing to stay,

19:06.120 --> 19:08.160
they will receive
double their monthly wages

19:08.240 --> 19:09.440
and be treated well.

19:10.760 --> 19:12.400
Understood, Your Majesty.

19:14.000 --> 19:15.280
Thank you, Your Majesty.

19:16.000 --> 19:18.200
Thank you, Your Majesty!

19:22.480 --> 19:23.720
The two of you,

19:24.320 --> 19:26.360
who claim to be
Nanzhao's greatest strategists,

19:27.400 --> 19:29.240
allowed your selfish motives

19:30.080 --> 19:33.320
to be exploited by a mere woman
and played right into her hands.

19:36.440 --> 19:37.480
You're fined a year's salary

19:37.560 --> 19:40.200
and prohibited from court discussions
for the next three months.

19:41.120 --> 19:42.800
Reflect on your mistakes.

19:44.440 --> 19:45.800
Your servant is guilty.

19:54.760 --> 19:57.960
Since the age of 19,
I have served the court.

19:58.640 --> 20:02.240
There hasn't been a single day
that I didn't attend court discussions.

20:02.320 --> 20:06.800
In nearly half a lifetime,
I have never suffered such humiliation.

20:08.480 --> 20:10.680
Ms. Ji, you're quite capable.

20:12.360 --> 20:14.080
I've learned my lesson.

20:16.800 --> 20:20.440
And congratulations to Prince Bai
for winning such a deadly beauty.

20:21.480 --> 20:22.800
Take care.

20:37.640 --> 20:39.000
Ji Yingying, stay.

20:39.080 --> 20:41.600
I have something to say to you.

20:43.000 --> 20:45.680
Everyone else, leave now.

20:50.240 --> 20:51.640
Get out, all of you!

21:17.200 --> 21:20.000
Do I look like a fool today?

21:21.720 --> 21:23.920
I was ready to take the blame for you,

21:24.000 --> 21:27.800
but instead, you played me like a puppet.

21:29.040 --> 21:31.440
I predicted Du Yan would use
fake brocade to frame you.

21:32.520 --> 21:34.520
I predicted you would destroy my brocade.

21:37.160 --> 21:40.520
But I truly didn't expect
you'd stand up to take the blame for me.

21:47.960 --> 21:49.000
Sheng Fengze,

21:51.080 --> 21:52.720
you've saved me many times,

21:55.040 --> 21:56.720
like the time my house caught fire,

21:57.920 --> 21:59.400
or when we were traveling on trade routes,

22:00.360 --> 22:02.240
or when we were chased by Niu Jin.

22:04.440 --> 22:06.480
Even though
you always had your own motives,

22:06.560 --> 22:08.240
you still protected me.

22:11.240 --> 22:13.040
I'm not heartless.

22:15.480 --> 22:19.080
I know everything you've done for me.

22:22.400 --> 22:23.960
But one person's kindness

22:25.200 --> 22:27.080
can't outweigh their wrongs.

22:29.960 --> 22:31.840
Then, how can I make up for it?

22:33.120 --> 22:33.960
Are you saying

22:36.800 --> 22:38.240
you want me to die?

22:44.240 --> 22:45.240
I don't know.

22:51.800 --> 22:53.800
I can't forgive you on behalf of others.

23:29.160 --> 23:30.120
Bai Sheng!

23:40.600 --> 23:41.560
Zhao Xiuyuan!

23:43.800 --> 23:45.920
You begged like a dog

23:46.680 --> 23:48.480
just to let Ji Yingying go.

23:49.520 --> 23:50.880
You schemed against everyone,

23:52.000 --> 23:53.920
only to be outsmarted
by someone else in the end.

23:55.240 --> 23:56.120
How does that feel?

23:56.720 --> 23:58.120
You leaked the information

24:00.080 --> 24:02.280
about the border chaos to Yang Jinglan.

24:03.160 --> 24:04.440
You're the real mole!

24:13.240 --> 24:14.480
Initially, Bai Sheng

24:15.800 --> 24:18.520
sent me to uncover your purpose here.

24:20.800 --> 24:21.840
And now, look what's happened.

24:23.960 --> 24:24.960
There's nothing left

24:26.360 --> 24:28.760
in this world for me to care about.

24:50.360 --> 24:51.720
Let's not talk about the past.

24:54.600 --> 24:56.280
Everything
that happened before was my fault.

24:58.560 --> 25:00.160
I have one request.

25:02.640 --> 25:04.280
Will you help me

25:05.840 --> 25:07.240
kill Niu Jin?

25:10.840 --> 25:12.160
If you agree, I, Zhao Xiuyuan,

25:13.280 --> 25:15.800
will ensure your return to Yizhou!

25:20.000 --> 25:22.360
The name of this bracelet
is called "Never Lost".

25:23.640 --> 25:25.040
Yang Jinglan told me about it.

25:26.240 --> 25:28.160
He said if I mentioned this,

25:28.680 --> 25:31.280
you'd believe that he and I
have already joined forces.

25:31.360 --> 25:32.760
So, you can trust me.

25:34.680 --> 25:36.000
You're not like Yang Jinglan.

25:36.960 --> 25:40.040
When he says he'll kill Niu Jin,
he actually means it.

25:40.120 --> 25:42.200
But you… You're
always weighing your options.

25:43.800 --> 25:46.360
Just like now, with your blade at my neck.

25:48.120 --> 25:49.280
Do you dare kill me?

25:50.160 --> 25:52.400
You keep saying you love Ji Yingying,

25:53.000 --> 25:55.800
acting all crazed,
claiming you'd do anything to have her.

25:56.840 --> 25:58.160
But that's not love.

26:00.080 --> 26:01.200
True love

26:01.880 --> 26:03.280
doesn't mean possession.

26:04.440 --> 26:05.440
True love

26:06.680 --> 26:08.400
is thinking about her every day,

26:09.440 --> 26:11.040
wondering if she's eaten enough,

26:11.960 --> 26:13.480
if she's warm,

26:14.080 --> 26:16.640
and if she's happy each day.

26:20.120 --> 26:21.400
Let me tell you, Bai Sheng…

26:23.840 --> 26:25.040
that's not love.

26:26.360 --> 26:27.480
Right now,

26:29.240 --> 26:30.800
you only love yourself.

27:15.400 --> 27:16.240
Now,

27:16.760 --> 27:18.400
I've rallied all
of Commissioner Mu's old troops.

27:19.040 --> 27:21.040
Once we defeat
the rebel army in the northwest,

27:22.200 --> 27:25.080
I will lead the entire army
to Yizhou's gates.

27:26.760 --> 27:29.720
General Xue, you're planning
to attack Yizhou City?

27:31.960 --> 27:33.320
Niu Jin is hiding like a coward.

27:33.400 --> 27:35.120
The court will never negotiate
or compromise

27:35.200 --> 27:36.160
with such a traitor.

27:36.240 --> 27:37.640
We have no choice but to attack.

27:38.920 --> 27:42.680
But… the civilians in Yizhou City
are all in Niu Jin's hands!

27:44.840 --> 27:48.320
My parents, my wife, and children
are also in the city.

27:48.920 --> 27:51.360
If the day comes
when the army surrounds the city,

27:52.520 --> 27:55.560
Niu Jin will surely
use my family as sacrifices.

27:56.640 --> 27:57.920
What should we do?

27:58.000 --> 27:59.160
Ten days.

28:00.000 --> 28:00.880
Give me ten days.

28:01.520 --> 28:03.040
Take down the leader
to capture the bandits.

28:03.120 --> 28:04.440
I'll sneak into the city
and give it a try.

28:05.080 --> 28:06.080
Are you confident?

28:06.160 --> 28:08.200
Even without confidence, I have to try.

28:08.280 --> 28:09.400
How will you do it?

28:09.480 --> 28:10.520
Yang Jinglan!

28:12.600 --> 28:14.960
Niu Jin has hung Zhuge's body

28:15.040 --> 28:16.000
at the city gate!

28:16.600 --> 28:18.440
- What?
- Yang Jinglan,

28:19.720 --> 28:21.800
this must be a trap set by Niu Jin
to lure you out.

28:23.600 --> 28:27.360
It's I who brought Zhuge
from Chang'an to Yizhou.

28:27.440 --> 28:30.840
Even if I must brave hell and high water,
I'll bring him back!

28:31.960 --> 28:33.960
Are you out of your mind? Yang Jinglan!

28:34.800 --> 28:37.480
General Xue, my son may be reckless,
but his loyalty and honor are priceless.

28:37.560 --> 28:38.840
Please, lend your support.

28:39.880 --> 28:42.400
- Deploy troops to protect them!
- Understood!

28:45.800 --> 28:49.680
YIZHOU

29:30.880 --> 29:32.320
Stay alert!

30:03.320 --> 30:04.480
Kill!

30:43.800 --> 30:44.920
Bro,

30:46.200 --> 30:47.200
I'm taking you home!

31:04.720 --> 31:06.120
Let's change his clothes.

31:13.520 --> 31:14.400
I'll do it.

31:32.720 --> 31:33.920
There's writing here.

31:36.560 --> 31:39.280
"Even in death,
the bones of a hero remain fragrant,

31:40.520 --> 31:42.560
unashamed before the world's finest."

31:44.320 --> 31:46.920
Is this what he left for you?

31:49.440 --> 31:50.880
It's what my master left for me.

31:52.320 --> 31:55.320
Back when Yizhou City
was surrounded on all sides,

31:56.080 --> 31:57.640
my master left me clues

31:57.720 --> 32:00.920
by carving them into his own bones.

32:02.520 --> 32:03.400
Yizhou City today

32:04.760 --> 32:05.800
is the same.

32:07.680 --> 32:08.680
Could it be

32:10.080 --> 32:12.640
he also used bone carving
to send a message?

32:14.040 --> 32:15.840
Aside from the marks on his wrists,

32:16.360 --> 32:18.560
there are no other injuries on his body.

32:19.160 --> 32:20.400
Are you overthinking it?

32:21.600 --> 32:22.600
No, I'm not.

32:24.120 --> 32:27.040
This writing is old.
It wasn't written recently.

32:27.760 --> 32:30.040
It was prepared in advance,

32:31.160 --> 32:35.160
as if he knew he might die at any moment

32:36.840 --> 32:38.320
and made arrangements ahead of time.

32:39.800 --> 32:42.680
Gao Fang, go fetch a coroner.

32:43.360 --> 32:45.840
- Are you sure?
- I'm sure.

32:46.760 --> 32:48.640
I'll go.

33:02.480 --> 33:03.320
Mr. Yang,

33:03.880 --> 33:06.000
I found this inside Mr. Zhuge's stomach.

33:10.320 --> 33:11.320
This pattern

33:11.840 --> 33:13.680
looks like a map.

33:16.280 --> 33:17.720
"On the 13th, the brocade exchange day,

33:18.320 --> 33:20.120
enter the dark path and chase the light."

33:23.040 --> 33:24.760
The 13th…

33:26.200 --> 33:27.160
Father, what do you think?

33:31.920 --> 33:33.920
In our brocade family,

33:34.600 --> 33:36.840
we pay tribute
to the military commissioner

33:36.920 --> 33:38.960
twice a year,

33:40.360 --> 33:42.960
at the beginning and middle of the year.

33:46.120 --> 33:47.320
If I'm not mistaken,

33:47.400 --> 33:50.440
the 14th of this month
is Niu Jin's birthday.

33:50.520 --> 33:51.440
So,

33:52.280 --> 33:53.640
the brocade must be delivered on the 13th.

33:54.480 --> 33:56.880
Isn't birthday tributes
usually delivered on the day itself?

33:56.960 --> 33:58.320
Usually, yes.

33:59.000 --> 34:02.720
But there's an exception.

34:03.840 --> 34:05.920
If the tribute isn't just brocade

34:06.960 --> 34:08.040
but brocade garments

34:08.760 --> 34:10.679
meant to be worn on the birthday,

34:11.280 --> 34:12.760
they have to be delivered early.

34:16.360 --> 34:17.719
That's to ensure a proper fitting.

34:18.719 --> 34:20.400
No matter where Niu Jin is hiding,

34:21.280 --> 34:22.239
they'll see him then.

34:23.880 --> 34:25.080
Exactly!

34:25.600 --> 34:28.600
So, what he's trying to tell us
is to follow the brocade delivery cart

34:29.159 --> 34:30.000
through the secret path.

34:32.520 --> 34:34.199
And he's also telling me

34:35.040 --> 34:36.560
to follow the firelight

34:37.880 --> 34:39.440
to find Niu Jin.

34:42.560 --> 34:45.360
This child really went to great lengths.

34:52.600 --> 34:54.239
Let him have a moment to himself.

35:02.120 --> 35:03.400
Zhuge,

35:06.760 --> 35:08.480
even in death,

35:10.360 --> 35:11.920
you still have so much to say.

35:17.960 --> 35:18.920
Yang Jinglan,

35:20.120 --> 35:21.400
if it were you,

35:21.480 --> 35:24.200
how would you pass this message along?

35:24.280 --> 35:26.680
ON THE 13TH, BROCADE EXCHANGE DAY
ENTER THE DARK PATH AND CHASE THE LIGHT

35:51.080 --> 35:52.640
So, it can't be carved into bones.

35:52.720 --> 35:55.040
With so much to say,
if I carved it all into bones,

35:55.120 --> 35:56.920
I'd end up looking like a sieve.

36:00.600 --> 36:02.040
Your favorite drink.

36:07.000 --> 36:08.080
Hurry, take it!

36:13.920 --> 36:14.920
What's wrong?

36:15.000 --> 36:17.320
Didn't you tell me
that heroes should be carefree

36:17.400 --> 36:19.720
and humorous,
so people will remember them?

36:23.760 --> 36:24.920
Who told you to be a hero?

36:25.680 --> 36:26.960
Did I tell you to be a hero?

36:27.040 --> 36:30.240
Or are you trying to steal my thunder?

36:31.560 --> 36:32.400
Let me just say this.

36:32.480 --> 36:34.880
All this time,
it's been you and Ji Yingying

36:34.960 --> 36:36.200
helping everyone.

36:36.280 --> 36:39.480
But Yizhou City belongs to all of us.

36:39.560 --> 36:42.040
It's my turn, Zhuge Hong,
to do something for everyone.

36:42.720 --> 36:45.960
Besides, you don't know
how much effort it took

36:46.040 --> 36:48.960
for me to provoke Niu Jin
and pass this message along.

36:49.720 --> 36:54.360
How were you so sure I'd return
to retrieve your body from the city walls?

36:56.640 --> 36:58.160
If I hadn't returned,

36:59.880 --> 37:01.280
wouldn't you have died in vain?

37:08.120 --> 37:10.080
Because you're Yang Jinglan.

37:14.240 --> 37:17.280
Even if it's just to come back
and scold me for being stupid,

37:17.360 --> 37:18.680
I know you'll come back.

37:28.720 --> 37:30.480
Don't look at me like that.

37:31.640 --> 37:33.080
I know I'm quite dashing.

37:38.400 --> 37:40.200
The wine really is that good.

37:42.160 --> 37:43.080
So…

37:44.480 --> 37:46.520
when you chose to stay in Yizhou,

37:47.680 --> 37:50.000
you've already made
this decision, didn't you?

37:53.520 --> 37:55.000
You've given up on the imperial exams?

37:59.320 --> 38:01.920
Let's focus on this
lifetime's responsibilities first.

38:02.960 --> 38:04.200
I've done everything I should.

38:04.280 --> 38:07.080
The rest is up to you.

38:08.840 --> 38:09.720
All right.

38:14.000 --> 38:15.040
I'm off.

38:22.240 --> 38:23.320
As for becoming the top scholar,

38:25.440 --> 38:26.560
let's leave that for the next life.

39:26.480 --> 39:27.880
Sang Shisi and the others are here.

39:28.680 --> 39:31.280
They've come to take
the craftsmen back home.

39:32.040 --> 39:33.600
But the craftsmen refuse to leave,

39:34.880 --> 39:36.160
saying they'll wait to leave with you.

39:37.040 --> 39:39.600
So, I told them you're sick,

39:39.680 --> 39:41.360
unable to leave right now.
You're recovering.

39:41.440 --> 39:44.760
Once you're better,
I'll personally escort you back.

39:46.520 --> 39:48.040
He will come to take me back.

39:50.440 --> 39:53.040
This place is so remote.
He won't be able to find it.

39:55.720 --> 39:58.400
After some time, I'll announce

39:59.000 --> 40:00.480
that you've fallen
gravely ill from overwork

40:00.560 --> 40:01.840
and passed away suddenly.

40:06.640 --> 40:08.560
You know he won't believe that.

40:09.440 --> 40:11.120
So, why bother with the pretense?

40:18.800 --> 40:21.360
In my life, I've done many business deals.

40:22.320 --> 40:24.640
The one I've lost the most in is you.

40:26.120 --> 40:28.800
What I've lost is my principles,

40:29.800 --> 40:31.160
my control.

40:32.640 --> 40:33.960
Deep down,

40:34.760 --> 40:37.920
I know clearly
there's no good ending for us.

40:38.520 --> 40:42.080
But I still can't let go.

40:54.240 --> 40:55.120
Go ahead and eat.

40:55.840 --> 40:57.520
It won't taste good once it's cold.

41:12.120 --> 41:14.680
Your Highness, His Majesty
has summoned you to the palace.

41:20.400 --> 41:22.280
Another meal was left unfinished.

41:38.000 --> 41:41.640
I'll come back early
to have dinner with you.

42:15.560 --> 42:16.600
Report!

42:18.000 --> 42:19.880
Your Highness, His Majesty
has summoned you to the palace.

42:26.160 --> 42:27.560
Why are you panicking?

42:27.640 --> 42:29.080
Aren't I already on my way to invite him?

42:29.160 --> 42:30.880
- Understood.
- Yes.

42:42.000 --> 42:43.720
You actually dare betray me!
